-- ============================================================================
-- D3 EXPERT DEEP SEED: Electrofacies, advanced tier.
--
-- Six modules, 26 lessons, 132 questions (15 per module bank plus a 42
-- question final exam), generated as the Associate tier's are.
--
-- What this tier owns: PREDICTING FACIES, AND THE ENGINE'S OWN RULES. k
-- nearest neighbours with the scaler fitted on the training rows, a tied vote
-- and equidistant neighbours; the CART tree with Gini impurity, midpoint
-- thresholds, depth and leaf limits, a printed tree; the root tie decided by
-- column order, a split that needs a decrease above zero, a tied leaf,
-- importances; the uncored wells predicted, checked against the synthetic
-- field's withheld facies once, and written back; every boundary rule by rule,
-- the tie band, the sign rule and the row caps; conventions that are choices
-- and what is not built. Digest sections 21 to 27.
--
-- THE TRAP THE TIER IS BUILT ON. A prediction is only as good as the rows it
-- was scaled and trained on: a well scaled on its own statistics, a gamma ray
-- read hot, or a tie broken by column order all change the answer, and a
-- range check sees only the rows that leave the range. The Expert capstone
-- grades six Expert quantities.
-- ============================================================================

values ('facies', 'advanced', '{"modules":[{"key":"m01-k-nearest-neighbours","title":"k Nearest Neighbours","lesson_keys":["l01-the-nearest-training-rows","l02-scaling-on-the-training-rows","l03-the-vote-and-a-tied-vote","l04-equidistant-neighbours","l05-choosing-k-for-neighbours"]},{"key":"m02-classification-trees","title":"Classification Trees","lesson_keys":["l01-gini-impurity","l02-midpoint-thresholds","l03-depth-leaves-and-minimum-rows","l04-reading-a-printed-tree"]},{"key":"m03-ties-and-exact-comparisons","title":"Ties and Exact Comparisons","lesson_keys":["l01-the-root-tie","l02-a-split-needs-a-decrease","l03-a-tied-leaf","l04-feature-importances"]},{"key":"m04-predicting-uncored-wells","title":"Predicting Uncored Wells","lesson_keys":["l01-training-on-the-cored-wells","l02-an-uncalibrated-tool","l03-checking-against-withheld-core","l04-neighbours-against-the-tree","l05-writing-facies-back"]},{"key":"m05-boundaries-and-caps","title":"Boundaries, Bands and Caps","lesson_keys":["l01-boundaries-rule-by-rule","l02-the-tie-band","l03-the-sign-rule","l04-row-caps"]},{"key":"m06-reading-the-engine-honestly","title":"Reading the Engine Honestly","lesson_keys":["l01-conventions-that-are-choices","l02-what-is-not-built","l03-writing-the-facies-note","l04-the-capstone-brief"]}]}'::jsonb, 1)
